{"seq":5,"slug":"ensemble-methods","title":"集成方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/classical-algorithms/ensemble-methods","wordCount":1005,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"集成方法\">集成方法</h1><h2 id=\"什么是集成学习\">什么是集成学习</h2><p>集成学习（Ensemble Learning）是将多个弱学习器组合成一个强学习器的策略。核心思想是&quot;三个臭皮匠，顶个诸葛亮&quot;——多个模型的组合往往比单个模型更稳定、更准确。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;训练数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;模型 1&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;模型 2&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;模型 3&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;...&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[&quot;模型 N&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;组合策略&lt;br/&gt;投票 / 平均 / 堆叠&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;最终预测&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"训练数据\"] --&gt; B[\"模型 1\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"模型 2\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"模型 3\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"...\"]\n    A --&gt; F[\"模型 N\"]\n    B --&gt; G[\"组合策略&lt;br/&gt;投票 / 平均 / 堆叠\"]\n    C --&gt; G\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[\"最终预测\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>集成方法围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基学习器（Base Learner）</strong>：被组合的单个模型，通常是一个精度略高于随机猜测的&quot;弱学习器&quot;（如深度受限的决策树）。集成的所有收益都以它为原料。</li>\n<li><strong>多样性与误差分解</strong>：集成的根本前提是基学习器之间<strong>犯错的地方不同</strong>。用偏差-方差语言说：<strong>Bagging 降低方差</strong>（并行、弱模型独立），<strong>Boosting 降低偏差</strong>（串行、逐步纠正剩余错误）。</li>\n<li><strong>组合策略</strong>：把多个预测合成一个的规则——分类用投票、回归用平均、Stacking 用元模型再学习。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者构成一条设计线索：<strong>先看要降低偏差还是方差，再选并行（Bagging）或串行（Boosting）的训练方式，最后决定组合策略</strong>。随机森林（Bagging + 列采样）与 XGBoost（Boosting + 正则化）都是在这三步上做不同取舍的产物。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"bagging\">Bagging</h2><p>Bagging（Bootstrap Aggregating）通过有放回的自助采样生成多个训练子集，分别训练基学习器，最终通过投票（分类）或平均（回归）得到结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;原始数据 N 条&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Bootstrap 采样 1&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Bootstrap 采样 2&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Bootstrap 采样 M&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;基模型 1&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;基模型 2&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;基模型 M&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;投票 / 平均&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;最终预测&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"原始数据 N 条\"] --&gt; B[\"Bootstrap 采样 1\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Bootstrap 采样 2\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Bootstrap 采样 M\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"基模型 1\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"基模型 2\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"基模型 M\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"投票 / 平均\"]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[\"最终预测\"]</pre><p>Bagging 的核心优势是<strong>降低方差</strong>，特别适合高方差的不稳定模型（如决策树）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.ensemble import BaggingClassifier&#10;from sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_wine&#10;from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split&#10;&#10;wine = load_wine()&#10;X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(&#10;    wine.data, wine.target, test_size=0.3, random_state=42&#10;)&#10;&#10;single_tree = DecisionTreeClassifier(random_state=42)&#10;single_tree.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;&#10;bagging = BaggingClassifier(&#10;    estimator=DecisionTreeClassifier(),&#10;    n_estimators=50, random_state=42&#10;)&#10;bagging.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;单棵决策树: {single_tree.score(X_test, y_test):.4f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;Bagging:    {bagging.score(X_test, y_test):.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.ensemble </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaggingClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DecisionTreeClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_wine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_wine()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    wine.data, wine.target, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">test_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">single_tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DecisionTreeClassifier(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">single_tree.fit(X_train, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bagging </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaggingClassifier(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    estimator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DecisionTreeClassifier(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_estimators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">random_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bagging.fit(X_train, y_train)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"单棵决策树: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">single_tree.score(X_test, y_test)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bagging:    </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bagging.score(X_test, y_test)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"随机森林\">随机森林</h2><p>随机森林（Random Forest）是 Bagging 的增强版本，在每次分裂时只从随机选取的特征子集中选择最优特征，进一步增加了基学习器之间的多样性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Bagging</th>\n<th>Random Forest</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样方式</td>\n<td>行采样</td>\n<td>行采样 + 列采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征选择</td>\n<td>使用全部特征</td>\n<td>每次分裂随机选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基学习器多样性</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>更高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗过拟合能力</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>更好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier&#10;from sklearn.datasets import load_breast_cancer&#10;from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;data = load_breast_cancer()&#10;X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(&#10;    data.data, data.target, test_size=0.3, random_state=42&#10;)&#10;&#10;rf = RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=100, random_state=42)&#10;rf.fit(X_train, y_train)&#10;print(f&quot;Random Forest 准确率: {rf.score(X_test, y_test):.4f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;importances = rf.feature_importances_&#10;top_k = 5&#10;indices = np.argsort(importances)[::-1][:top_k]&#10;print(f&quot;\\nTop {top_k} 重要特征:&quot;)&#10;for i, idx in enumerate(indices):&#10;    print(f&quot;  {i+1}. {data.feature_names[idx]:30s} {importances[idx]:.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.ensemble </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomForestClassifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.datasets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_breast_cancer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.model_selection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_test_split</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_breast_cancer()</span>